{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Ready to Become a Whale?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A &quot;whale&quot; refers to someone who spends an outrageous amount of money on online games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They may be scorned for wasting money, but in the game world, their overwhelming strength earns admiration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a simulation game where you can experience life as one of these legendary whales.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on part-time jobs, start a company, earn money, and sink it all into a virtual social game!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore the City!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796480/extras/gif1.gif?t=1750335510\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Various events will occur around the city. Complete them to earn valuable rewards!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Work and Earn Money!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796480/extras/gif2.gif?t=1750335510\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plenty of job options are available. Find the one you like and start making money!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Level Up Your Skills and Get Promoted!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796480/extras/gif3.gif?t=1750335510\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Improve your skill levels to earn more income from your jobs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Run Your Own Business!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796480/extras/gif4.gif?t=1750335510\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can also start and manage your own company to generate higher profits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Recruit Talented Employees!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796480/extras/gif5.gif?t=1750335510\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hiring skilled workers will boost your business\u2019s earnings even further.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Spend Big in Online Games!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796480/extras/gif6.gif?t=1750335510\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your earnings to spin the gacha and collect powerful characters!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Climb the Rankings!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796480/extras/gif7.gif?t=1750335510\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rival whales await in the online game world. Use your spending power to crush the competition!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Streaming &amp; Video Guidelines</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We warmly welcome gameplay videos, streams, and let's plays of this game. Monetization is also allowed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Both individuals and organizations are free to create content without restriction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If possible, please include the link to the Steam store page in the description of your video or stream.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3796480?t=1750335510","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3796480/1de902ac546ea65fdefdf0a12c57b80f56b435f8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750335510","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/